<Layout title="Theoria — Architecture | Conor Brown" description="Theoria's curriculum model and application architecture for practical music education.">
<main class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Project walkthrough · Product architecture</p><h1>Theoria</h1><p class="lead">Theoria is an interactive music-learning platform covering music theory, playing, production, mixing, and mastering. It adapts the learning-system patterns developed for Pathway to a different educational domain.</p>
